    "detailed_description": "&quot;HOLEHOLE&quot; is an adventure game where players collect scattered objects on the map, engage in conversations and assist residents, and prepare for the next exploration by performing various actions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne day, the player accidentally falls into a certain hole and freely explores the dungeon to find objects and search for residents. However, it is also a player's choice to not engage in exploration.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEven inside this hole, there is no specific purpose to each day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Progress through a combination of visual novel-style storytelling and interactions with residents.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    There are no markers for objects or quests, allowing players to freely play as they wish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    There are few pressured tasks, allowing for a relaxed gameplay experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6How to achieve the true ending<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEat to increase your status.<br />\r\nWin the one and only battle.<br />\r\nGive items to three people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Video Streaming Guidelines<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbRegardless of whether you are an individual or a business entity, streaming is allowed without the need for permission.",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;HOLEHOLE&quot; is an adventure game where players collect scattered objects on the map, engage in conversations and assist residents, and prepare for the next exploration by performing various actions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne day, the player accidentally falls into a certain hole and freely explores the dungeon to find objects and search for residents. However, it is also a player's choice to not engage in exploration.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEven inside this hole, there is no specific purpose to each day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Progress through a combination of visual novel-style storytelling and interactions with residents.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    There are no markers for objects or quests, allowing players to freely play as they wish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    There are few pressured tasks, allowing for a relaxed gameplay experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6How to achieve the true ending<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEat to increase your status.<br />\r\nWin the one and only battle.<br />\r\nGive items to three people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Video Streaming Guidelines<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbRegardless of whether you are an individual or a business entity, streaming is allowed without the need for permission.",
